 "summary": "Adds checks for CoinGrinder's `GetAlgoCompleted()` flag across wallet unit tests and fuzz harnesses. The assertions verify that the flag is set to true when the UTXO search space is exhausted before hitting the 100,000 attempt limit, and false when it hits that limit.",
 "problem": "No unit test inspects the `GetAlgoCompleted()` flag returned by `CoinGrinder`, and the fuzz targets only read it to decide whether to check solution optimality. A bug or mutation setting the flag incorrectly would go unnoticed by test suites.",
 "evidence": [
  "PR description notes that it kills two specific mutation testing mutants (mutants 4401 and 4402 on mutanthub.space) where `result.SetAlgoCompleted` is inverted upon exhaustion or reaching the attempt limit."
